"Over FTP or a file manager: replace everything in <code>wp-"
"content/shipstatic-lockdown.php</code> with just <code>&lt;?php</code> "
"(don’t delete it: PHP needs it while <code>.user.ini</code> points to it), "
"then delete the <code># BEGIN ShipStatic Lockdown</code> block from "
"<code>.htaccess</code> and the <code>; BEGIN ShipStatic Lockdown</code> "
"lines from <code>.user.ini</code>. Renaming the plugin folder alone isn’t "
"enough."
msgstr ""
"Via FTP o file manager: sostituisci tutto il contenuto di <code>wp-"
"content/shipstatic-lockdown.php</code> con <code>&lt;?php</code> (non "
"eliminarlo: PHP ne ha bisogno finché <code>.user.ini</code> vi rimanda), poi"
" elimina il blocco <code># BEGIN ShipStatic Lockdown</code> da "
"<code>.htaccess</code> e le righe <code>; BEGIN ShipStatic Lockdown</code> "
"da <code>.user.ini</code>. Rinominare solo la cartella del plugin non basta."

#: src/Support/I18n.php:218
